                <mxCell id="note" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;strokeColor=#999999;rounded=0;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fontSize=17;" value="&lt;b&gt;Notes (not drawn as tiers)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• LLM: every agent calls Groq (openai/gpt-oss-120b) through the CrewAI/litellm wrapper in crew_agents.py (_make_llm()).&lt;br&gt;• Database: both routes read/write the same SQLite store via chat_db.py (sessions, messages, feedback, users).&lt;br&gt;• Core logic: crew_pipeline.py sits between routes and agents. Clinical functions (parse_nl_to_clips, build_conversational_response, classify_and_plan_ligation_with_llm, run_pipeline) are called only by routes/clinical.py; generate_general_response() only by routes/general.py.&lt;br&gt;• services.call_llm() and services.groq_client are unused (dead code)." vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="160" width="950" x="170" y="730" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
